// ===================================================== instanceof =========
//
// 'new F()' for a plain constructor FUNCTION: its instances need a class descriptor
// to answer instanceof with. Memoized on the function's identity (two parallel
// arrays plus a === scan: there is no Map in the subset), so two instances of the
// same constructor share a descriptor.

