// identity-keyed side-table lookup over two parallel arrays - which are SHARED as
// rtPairGet in lib/runtime.metajs. This copy is DECLINED, and not on the body:
// this file does not import lib/runtime.metajs, it defines a js_supercall of its
// own (a straight name collision with that file's), and runtime.metajs asks its
// importers for seven rtk* hooks. Eight lines do not buy js-rt's first import of
// the shared runtime. If that import ever happens for another reason, this body
// and the scan inlined in js_jsctordesc above both go.
